 232  41F5              ; show: the pairs' patterns at the scroll's shift, NB bytes after the paper
 233  41F5              ; (chapter 29), each shift in a page of its own: the page is high shifts plus
 234  41F5              ; the shift, and no multiplication. The NB bytes go by NB OUTIs one after
 235  41F5              ; another, 18 T-states a byte: the border takes them as fast as that (chapter
